[101.3447, "o", "◉ goal done Fixed two bugs in shop/discounts.py:\r\n1. Changed BULK condition from `total > BULK_MINIMUM` to `total >= BULK_MINIMUM` so that the discount applies at the minimum threshold (5000 cents).\r\n2. Changed BULK discount calculation from `int(total * RATES[code])` to `int(total * (1 - RATES[code]))` to apply a 15% discount (i.e., pay 85% of the total) instead of incorrectly returning the discount amount.\r\nAfter changes, all tests pass: python3 -m unittest -q runs successfully with no failures.\r\n\r\n"]
